OL,3,GWales
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FA few
OL,6,Fshowers continuing overnight,
OL,7,Fespecially in the north and west. The
OL,8,Fwind however gradually easing
OL,9,Fovernight, with the clearest skies
OL,10,Ftowards the east. Feeling cooler.
OL,11,
OL,12,CThursday:FA risk of a few showers
OL,13,Fduring the morning, but much of Wales
OL,14,Fbecoming dry with sunny spells by the
OL,15,Fafternoon. Lighter winds than today
OL,16,Fwith temperatures around average.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
