OL,5,COutlook for Friday to Sunday:FRemaining
OL,6,Flargely dry and bright on Friday and
OL,7,FSaturday with temperatures also
OL,8,Fincreasing. A risk of some showers on
OL,9,FSunday but staying dry and warm for
OL,10,Fmost.
